        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 2.76m x 2.01m \r\n\r\n\r\nHome Office/Bedroom 4 - 3.09m x 2.84m \r\n\r\n\r\nShower Room - 1.77m x 1.86m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.46m x 3.97m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 6.24m x 2.98m \r\n\r\n\r\nDining Room - 3.44m x 2.98m \r\n\r\n\r\nSun Room - 3.44m x 3.36m \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 2.42m x 3.81m \r\nwith hot-press\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.96m x 2.7m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.36m x 3.21m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.81m x 4.05m \r\n\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.36m x 0.81m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.81m x 2.79m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
